      "speaker_id": "wen_zhaoye",
      "expression": "questioning",
      "outfit": "default",
      "text": "温照野把折断的木签放在透明石子罐旁：他们说我的根值最高，就该替所有人点灯。可我只想先知道，姐姐的名字为什么又出现在一张没有人承认的契上。",
      "next": "wz_choice_01"
    },
    {
      "id": "wz_choice_01",
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "wz_choice_child_voice",
          "text": "先问每个孩子今天愿意接受什么，不把根值当成同意。",
          "next": "wz_line_02",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "relation_delta", "character_id": "wen_zhaoye", "stat": "respect", "delta": 2},
            {"type": "set_flag", "flag": "wen_zhaoye_child_voice_first", "value": true}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "wz_choice_sister_record",
          "text": "先封存温照岚的旧信和契号，再谈任何修院或医床条件。",
          "next": "wz_line_02",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "relation_delta", "character_id": "wen_zhaoye", "stat": "trust", "delta": 2},
            {"type": "set_flag", "flag": "wen_zhaoye_sister_record_first", "value": true}
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "wz_line_02",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker_id": "wen_zhaoye",
      "expression": "resolute",
      "outfit": "default",
      "text": "他把白石换成代表想停的颜色：石子只能帮人说话，不能替人答应。若有人今天改变主意，也要把旧答案留下，不许说他一开始就欠了谁。",
      "next": "wz_effect_01"
    },
